# (even after `git add -f`); tests/test_public_boundary.py keeps the two lists in step.
# docs/ is the public Pages folder: personal notes go in notes/, not docs/.
docs/CONTEXT.md
docs/discussion/
CLAUDE.md
notes/
poster/archive/
docs/*_preview.png
results/spend_ledger.json

